# Machine git repo #1 (research_agent_teams) — the ephemeral run-store is NEVER committed.
# Two-repo boundary: this repo is the machine only; System D (PhD-Research-OS) is a separate repo.

# Ephemeral run-store (blueprint §10): runs are throwaway, crash-safe, gitignored.
# Layout: runs/<project>/<run_id>/ (project-grouped) or legacy flat runs/<run_id>/.
runs/

# Per-project durable workspaces (pulled results / scripts / figures / notes) — data, not code.
# Deletable as a unit via `operate project-delete`; regenerated by `operate project-init`.
# `projects/*` rather than `projects/` so a single project can be re-included below (git cannot
# negate anything inside a directory that was excluded wholesale).
projects/*

# EXCEPTION — the T4 example is evidence, not data. It is the only record of the three honesty
# results (a worker that lost its stream, a worker that refused to overwrite a changed file, three
# blind judges preferring the independent challenger), it is what
# `tools/example_replay.py` re-derives, and 8 tests in tests/test_t4_*.py hard-require it. Left
# untracked it existed on exactly one disk while the suite silently depended on it. Design-only:
# 87 files, ~735 KB of JSON/markdown, secret-scanned, no data and no credentials.
!projects/t4-scribble-m0-mechanism-eval/

# …but never the generated home page inside it — `workbench reindex` rewrites it, so tracking it
# would produce a diff on every reindex. `projectors.py::write_home_pages` regenerates it on demand.
projects/*/PROJECT-HOME.md

# Secrets — NEVER commit real credentials. Only .env.example (placeholders) is tracked.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
*_rsa
*_ed25519
id_*
credentials*
secrets*
*.secret

# Workbench projection (v4) — a rebuildable cache over the machine + the vault.
# It holds no source of truth: delete it and `research reindex` restores it exactly.
.workbench/

# Local runtime telemetry / mutable registries — state, not code.
.harness/
workspace/*.jsonl

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
